    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d122">

                <pb facs="0178" n="170" sameAs="frus:frus1938v01/pg170"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.52/119: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Seville</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Seville</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-01T13:00:00+00:00">April 1, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 1—1 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. A letter from the office of General Queipo de Llano<anchor n="36"
                        xml:id="d122-f1"/> has been received this morning which in translation reads
                    as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Minister of Foreign Affairs of the National Government in Burgos has
                            requested me to inform you that in order to discuss various questions an
                            interview with the chiefs of that Ministry would be convenient. <pb
                                facs="0179" n="171" xml:id="pg171"/> He desires that the interview
                            take place in Burgos and that he be informed of the date of your arrival
                            in that capital.</p>
                        <p>In communicating the foregoing it is requested that you indicate to me
                            for communication to the mentioned authority when you shall make the
                            trip.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Will the Department inform me what answer should be made to this
                    communication?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d122-f1" n="36" xml:id="d122-f1-content">
                <p>Nationalist general in command of Seville area.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
